{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"玛丽·居里·核心贡献","stage":"DONE","category":"marie-curie","categoryLabel":"玛丽·居里","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/30_marie-curie/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"玛丽-居里-核心贡献\">玛丽·居里·核心贡献</h1><p>玛丽·居里主题共分六卷。本卷（第二卷）回答一个具体问题：<strong>她为科学留下了什么</strong>——不是她如何度过一生，不是她的性格与信念，而是那些在她身后仍在运转的概念、实物、单位、疗法与机构。换句话说，生平卷讲&quot;人&quot;，本卷讲&quot;成果本身&quot;；读完后你应当能说清：放射性概念是怎么确立的、钋和镭是怎么被拿出手的、&quot;居里&quot;这个单位从哪来、放射治疗与镭研究所有何渊源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷与兄弟卷的分工边界\">本卷与兄弟卷的分工边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 生平</td>\n<td>她的人生轨迹</td>\n<td>她如何成为科学家</td>\n<td>只讲经历与事件；科学内容一律留给本卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 核心贡献（本卷）</td>\n<td>放射性科学的奠基</td>\n<td>她留下了什么</td>\n<td>概念、元素、计量标准、疗法、机构五类成果及其来龙去脉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 思想与方法</td>\n<td>方法论提炼</td>\n<td>她怎么想、怎么做</td>\n<td>抽象出测量优先等方法原则；本卷只在使用处带过方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 主要著作</td>\n<td>论文与奖项事实</td>\n<td>她写了什么、得了什么奖</td>\n<td>以文本和奖项为纲；本卷讲这些成果的科学内涵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 影响与遗产</td>\n<td>后世回响</td>\n<td>她改变了哪些领域</td>\n<td>从她去世之后讲起；本卷止于她在世时的直接成果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6 争议与评价</td>\n<td>批判性再审视</td>\n<td>如何全面地看她</td>\n<td>集中处理争议；本卷以史学共识为坐标，不展开争论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断某段内容属于哪一卷的试金石：讲&quot;1902 年她如何提纯出 0.1 克氯化镭&quot;是本卷的事；讲&quot;这次提纯体现的坚持品格&quot;归第三卷；讲&quot;1935 年约里奥-居里夫妇获奖如何延续她的路线&quot;归第五卷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>快速通道（约 30 分钟，想知道&quot;她到底做了什么&quot;）</strong>：按顺序通读本卷三章的六篇文档即可——三章本身就是认知递进：先有概念（第 1 章），再有实物与标准（第 2 章），最后有应用与建制（第 3 章）。</li>\n<li><strong>完整通道（想理解&quot;为什么这些成果重要&quot;）</strong>：精读第 1 章两篇的概念推理链 → 精读第 2 章的方法与工艺细节 → 第 3 章结合平衡视角阅读应用史。</li>\n<li><strong>技术型读者</strong>：可直接跳到含公式的段落——第 1 篇的电离测量原理、第 3 篇的衰变定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\lambda N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 与半衰期、第 5 篇的平方反比剂量几何——再回补叙事背景。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>本卷不假设读者受过物理或化学专业训练，但以下概念会反复出现，各篇首次用到时均有就地解释：原子与元素的区别（原子是化学变化的最小单元，元素由同种原子组成）；化合物形态与元素含量的区分（第 1 章的核心实验变量）；活度、半衰期与指数衰减（第 2 章给出 KaTeX 定义）；周期表作为元素&quot;户口系统&quot;的含义（第 2 章）。若读过本主题第一卷（生平），会更容易理解人物动机，但这不是必要前提——本卷内容自足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>以下链接指向同主题其他各卷，属可选探索入口；不读它们不影响本卷的完整性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平卷：波兰与觉醒、巴黎与发现、盛名与晚年</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法卷：测量优先的方法论</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作卷：论文、奖项与历史性第一次</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产卷：科学与社会的回响</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价卷：安全、神话与史学再评价</a></li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"founding-radioactivity","title":"放射性科学的奠基","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/core-contributions/founding-radioactivity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-concept-of-radioactivity","title":"放射性概念的确立：从贝克勒尔射线到原子内在属性","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/core-contributions/founding-radioactivity/the-concept-of-radioactivity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"polonium-radium-and-new-elements","title":"钋与镭：以放射性为向导的元素发现","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/core-contributions/founding-radioactivity/polonium-radium-and-new-elements"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"isolating-and-quantifying","title":"镭的分离与定量","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/core-contributions/isolating-and-quantifying","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"isolation-and-atomic-weight","title":"纯镭的分离与原子量测定：从推断到实物","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/core-contributions/isolating-and-quantifying/isolation-and-atomic-weight"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-international-radium-standard","title":"国际镭标准与居里单位：放射性计量学的奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/core-contributions/isolating-and-quantifying/the-international-radium-standard"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications-and-institutions","title":"科学应用与建制遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/core-contributions/applications-and-institutions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"radium-in-medicine-and-radiotherapy","title":"镭与医学：放射治疗的起源","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/core-contributions/applications-and-institutions/radium-in-medicine-and-radiotherapy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"radium-institutes-and-the-curie-school","title":"镭研究所与居里学派：把发现变成建制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/core-contributions/applications-and-institutions/radium-institutes-and-the-curie-school"}]}]}